  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to HAP, 2015</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this grant is to support the Humanitarian Accountability Partnership International (HAP) in its work on further development and dissemination of the Core Humanitarian Standard. Furthermore the objective of the grant is to support HAP in the transition period leading up to the formal merger with people in Aid. HAP will from January 2016 be absorbed by a new legal entity, the CHA International Alliance, and will by this date continue its activities under the new organisation. A new multiyear application for 2016-2018 will be submitted to donors in the name of the new organisation by Medio 2015</narrative>
  </description>
